{"id":1114734,"xmlId":"JavaScript","name":"JavaScript and TypeScript","description":"<p>Provides support for working with JavaScript and TypeScript.\n    </p><h2>Features</h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Code completion</li>\n      <li>In-product documentation</li>\n      <li>Code formatting</li>\n      <li>Code inspections and quick fixes</li>\n      <li>Refactorings such as <i>Rename</i>, <i>Move</i>, <i>Extract Variable</i>, and more</li>\n      <li>Code snippets (<i>Live Templates</i>)</li>\n      <li>TypeScript Language Service support</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <p>The plugin is bundled in IntelliJ IDEA, WebStorm, PhpStorm, PyCharm, RubyMine, GoLand, Rider, and CLion.\n    </p><h2>Getting started</h2>\n<p>Open your JavaScript or TypeScript project in the IDE or create a new one.\nThe JavaScript and TypeScript plugin will automatically detect the presence of related files and provide its features accordingly.\n</p><p>For more information on getting started, head over to the <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/help/\">documentation</a> for your IDE.</p>\n<h2>Getting started</h2>\nOpen your JavaScript or TypeScript project in the IDE or create a new one. The JavaScript and TypeScript plugin will automatically detect the presence of related files and provide its features accordingly.\n<br>\nFor more information on getting started, head over to the <a>documentation</a> for your IDE.","organization":"JetBrains s.r.o.","tags":["Programming Language"],"version":"262.8665.337","optionalDependencies":["intellij.platform.commercial.verifier","intellij.platform.structuralSearch","intellij.platform.coverage","intellij.rd.client","intellij.indexing.shared.core","intellij.javascript.newProject","intellij.javascript.testing","JavaScriptDebugger","intellij.platform.split.protocol","intellij.javascript.structureView","intellij.javascript.backend","intellij.sh.core","intellij.platform.scriptDebugger.ui","intellij.java.psi","intellij.platform.duplicatesDetector","intellij.css.backend","com.i